@startuml agentic-product-value-stream-boundary
title Agentic Product / Agentic Value Stream Boundary , per ADR-ES-016 §11

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

class "Agentic Value Stream" as AVS
class "Stakeholder Value" as SV
class "Agentic Product" as AP

AVS --> SV : realizes
AVS --> AP : may involve

class "Agentic Value Stream" as AVS
class "Agentic Product" as AP

note right
  Per ADR-ES-016 §11 + APROD-CON-016 + APROD-NEG-006 + APROD-NEG-015:
  - Agentic Product is NOT Agentic Value Stream
  - Agentic Value Stream is NOT Agentic Product
  - A conventional Product may participate in an Agentic Value Stream
end note

@enduml
